WEBVTT

01:03:28.542 --> 01:03:31.809
So Hirschman wrote
about exit, voice and loyalty,

01:03:31.833 --> 01:03:34.434
there's an addition now of neglect.

01:03:34.458 --> 01:03:38.268
So when you're dissatisfied
with a job or a person

01:03:38.292 --> 01:03:40.726
or an organization, or a country, right?

01:03:40.750 --> 01:03:43.143
You have, I think,
as far as I know, four choices.

01:03:43.167 --> 01:03:44.684
You can leave, that's an exit.

01:03:44.708 --> 01:03:47.309
You can speak up and try
to change it, that's voice.

01:03:47.333 --> 01:03:51.351
You can neglect, where you do
the absolute minimum not to get fired,

01:03:51.375 --> 01:03:52.934
that's office space.

01:03:52.958 --> 01:03:57.226
And then the final option is loyalty,
which is basically to say,

01:03:57.250 --> 01:04:00.143
"Look, I'm committed enough
to this person or system